ant/releases/tag/v1.11.0","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","code","coding","large-language-model","llm","programming","workflow"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"具备远程连接、工作流式对话等功能的完整智能体开发环境。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Reliant 是一个不止于对话的桌面 AI 编码助手。你可以通过自然对话与代码库交互，并借助可编程工作流将这种交互扩展为自动化复杂的多步骤开发任务。\n\n主要特性：\n- 与代码库对话 — AI 理解你的项目结构，可以读取文件并在对话间保持上下文。\n- 可编程工作流 — 用 YAML 定义可重复的多步骤流程，并随代码一起版本化。\n- 多智能体模式 — 派生并行智能体、实现辩论模式，或将多个专职智能体串联起来。\n- Git worktree — 在独立分支中隔离工作，无需切换上下文。\n- 任意 LLM 提供商 — Anthropic、OpenAI、Google Gemini、GitHub Copilot、AWS Bedrock、Azure、Groq、OpenRouter 等。\n- MCP 支持 — 通过 Model Context Protocol 服务器扩展能力。\n- 配置即代码 — 工作流和预设以 .reliant/ 文件的形式存放在你的仓库中。","tags":["人工智能","代码","大模型","大语言模型","工作流","智能体","编程","聊天机器人","自主智能"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/reliant-labs/reliant/issues","publisherUrl":"https://reliantlabs.io/","releaseDate":"2026-11-09","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/reliant-labs/reliant/releases/tag/v1.11.0","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"c3b6687c722ff0254bcc8eb87ed90b00ac0646b5","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/r/ReliantLabs/Reliant/1.11.0/ReliantLabs.Reliant.installer.yaml","sha256":"691d909a6907fe124fb08d12e6a5e5784b2e3ace02218292cf251f393389a493"},{"path":"manifests/r/ReliantLabs/Reliant/1.11.0/ReliantLabs.Reliant.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"ed6fa5c496f7e4201e77eecac107114f44dace85aecfedb558ba7f143c34eba1"},{"path":"manifests/r/ReliantLabs/Reliant/1.11.0/ReliantLabs.Reliant.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"b986bd275c8f76757ea04a901a3b639e85b7ff78b3ed58d6f60397e4671c55a4"},{"path":"manifests/r/ReliantLabs/Reliant/1.11.0/ReliantLabs.Reliant.yaml","sha256":"00e76c6030e1b0c0898e66abac852c388d75b930e3733dbd652a1e1c0078555d"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.11.0"}